<title>USA: Clinton to meet Big Three automaker execs June 27.</title>
<headline>Clinton to meet Big Three automaker execs June 27.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton will meet top executives of the Big Three automakers on June 27, the White House announced on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Spoksman Mike McCurry said Clinton would want to discuss with them the impact on the auto industry of U.S. agreements with Japan to increase exports to Japan of more American-made automobiles and parts.</p>
<p>He will also want to discuss with them their job-creation efforts during the current economic expansion, McCurry said.</p>
